# Changelog

All notable changes to the Space Travelers Universal Playlist Engine will be documented in this file.

## [11.1.0] - 2026-06-06
### Fixed
- Corrected Hugging Face dataset telemetry mapping from generic row indexes to explicit `resonance_frequency_khz` schema fields.
- Added dynamic numerical type fallback for payload feature extraction in `PredictorZone`.

### Added
- Standalone browser test harness (`tests.html`) for offline unit and integration verification.

## [11.0.0] - 2026-06-01
### Added
- Initial decoupled architecture separating `PredictorZone` and `CoreAlgorithmEngine`.
- 121-Node Phi-harmonic grid weighting using Golden Ratio mass attenuation.
- Ternary intent state machine (`-1`, `0`, `1`) anchored by `@` and Node 120 (`||`).
- $60 \times 60$ ROM checksum and receipt validation pipeline.
